sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Worker A
    participant R as Lease/token service
    participant B as Worker B
    participant S as Resource
    Note over A: Previously received token 1
    Note over R: Lease for A expires
    B->>R: Acquire lease
    R-->>B: token 2
    Note over B: Has not written yet
    A->>S: Write token 1
    Note over S: last_token=0, so 1 can be accepted
    S-->>A: ACCEPT
    B->>S: Write token 2
    S-->>B: ACCEPT
    Note over S: Fencing orders accepted writes, not real-time lease validity
